# Every file is checked out exactly as it was committed.
#
# Several files are compared byte for byte - data/.htaccess against the constant
# that rewrites it, index.html against what tools/assets.php would stamp - and a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf turned their line endings into CRLF, so
# the test suite failed on a clean clone before anything had been changed. No
# conversion in either direction keeps what is on disk identical to what was
# released, which is also what the update archive installs.
* -text
